{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22531","headline":"自江陵之徐州路上寄兄弟 · 白居易","name":"自江陵之徐州路上寄兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岐路南将北，离忧弟与兄。\n关河千里别，风雪一身行。\n夕宿劳乡梦，晨装惨旅情。\n家贫忧後事，日短念前程。\n烟鴈飜寒渚，霜乌聚古城。\n谁怜陟冈者，西楚望南荆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}